OL,3,GNEWSA#4.5m pavilion redevelopment
OL,4,Aapproved amid row
OL,5,
OL,6,FA defunct pavilion is to be remodelled
OL,7,Fusing #4.5m of funding from developers.
OL,9,FHertsmere Borough Council's cabinet
OL,10,Fagreed on Wednesday to turn the
OL,11,Fbuilding at Aycliffe Park in
OL,12,FBorehamwood, Hertfordshire into "a
OL,13,Fwelcoming space for all ages" using
OL,14,Fmoney from the Community Infrastructure
OL,15,FLevy.
OL,17,FConservative opposition councillor
OL,18,FHarvey Cohen described the spending as
OL,19,F"outrageous" and said his party had "a
OL,20,Flot of concerns".
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
